BEGIN_DESC
TANTRA BETA 8 - Low Earth orbit, commander's seat.
The Tantra in low Earth orbit (the date and neighbours of Orbiter's classic scenario: the ISS and Mir). Anamezon traps full,
the field store charged, the planetary engine pods turned aft. Niza Krit sits in the commander's seat of the bridge capsule;
the person keeps the focus: everything is done from the seat with the mouse and the numpad.
INSIDE: F stand up / sit down at a seat (not in the suit); W/S/A/D/Q/E walk, Shift run, right mouse held turns the body with the look.
Left click: screens and buttons within reach. V (in the commander's seat): outside view of the ship, V again back.
BRIDGE: front screen tabs FLIGHT / ENGINES / PARAMETERS; side screens carry six Orbiter MFDs; left screen MECHANISMS (+ thermal),
right screen POWER PLANT. Planetary engines: numpad + / - throttle, Ctrl + full, Ctrl - zero, * cut. Attitude numpad 2/8 4/6 1/3,
/ rotation/linear, 5 kill rotation.
ANAMEZON: ENGINES - IGNITION (field - kaon beam - feed). Near Earth it is locked by radiation (an oxygen world, crews nearby);
the bypass needs two presses within 3 s. The exhaust's shock nodes stretch hundreds of km behind - watch from outside (V).
G-limiter on ENGINES, compensator up to 200 g.
END_DESC

